#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Storage Engine v7 — XorRS Unified (Automatic Mode)
#  File: storage_engine_v7_xorrs_unified.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS Storage Engine v7:
#      • Unified XorRS hybrid (Classic + Advanced + Tiered)
#      • Local XOR parity
#      • Secondary local parity
#      • Global Reed-Solomon parity
#      • Automatic repair path selection
#      • Distributed shard placement
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Local Parity](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Local_Parity)
#    - [Secondary Local Parity](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Secondary_Parity)
#    - [Global RS Parity](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Global_RS)
#    - [Automatic Repair](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Automatic_Repair)
#    - [Distributed Sharding](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Distributed_Shards)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create_volume(name, size_mb, nodes)
#         Creates XorRS Unified volume.
#
#    - write(volume_id, data)
#         Encodes data into groups, local parity, secondary parity, global RS.
#
#    - read(volume_id, shard_ids)
#         Automatically selects best repair path.
#
#    - snapshot(volume_id)
#         Creates distributed snapshot.
#
#    - restore(snapshot_id)
#         Restores shard map from snapshot.
#
#    - engine_snapshot()
#         Returns engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  SHARD MAP FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "XRSVOL-XXXX": {
#          "SHR-A": "NODE-1",
#          "SHR-B": "NODE-2",
#          "SHR-C": "NODE-3",
#          ...
#      }
#    }
#
